Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:02.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every generation before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}yours had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yours may be the first that won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:07.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because labs now treat death
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as an engineering problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And they've pointed AI at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So picture the day it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The offer is in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No more aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:17.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No end date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yes, or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If you could stop dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most people say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the labs aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}waiting for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some want to copy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a mind into a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And they've started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A real fly's brain was mapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.07,0:00:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wire by wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a simple computer model
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}built from that map
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}began to steer a virtual body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:42.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There's a second way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to stop dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:47.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Repair the body you already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it comes with a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}2032.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The date comes from Ray Kurzweil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the inventor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and longtime futurist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So, by roughly 2032,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}when you live through a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you'll get back an entire year
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from scientific progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His claim: a year back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for every year you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's what "won't die"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}means here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An accident could still kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Old age couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:17.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But Kurzweil has moved
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:18.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his date before,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:19.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and he sells books
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about this future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:23.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Critics note that no peer-reviewed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}study stands behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And at today's pace of progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one blogger's analysis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:29.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from this summer lands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.70,0:01:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}somewhere else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:32.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A leading aging
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:33.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}researcher shared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its result: not 2032.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Around 2459.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In your lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or four centuries too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.37,0:01:46.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And even that analysis says:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no chance, unless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI speeds things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the first generation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that won't die is a bet on AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:56.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is that bet paying off?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There are early signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI models are learning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to predict how a living cell
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}reacts to a drug,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:04.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before anyone runs the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And in a study
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}published this October,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:08.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machine learning helped
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}researchers pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a single gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They boosted it in old mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The mice lived about 14% longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A small study.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Female mice only.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not yet repeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And no drug against aging
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.55,0:02:25.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}itself is approved anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:27.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the date is a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The work is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But what if the repairs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:32.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}come too late for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then the copy is what's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Back to that fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This March,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a San Francisco startup plugged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that simple brain model
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.53,0:02:43.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}into a virtual body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the model began to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:46.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:47.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:49.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The startup's headline:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we've uploaded a fruit fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:53.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Critics said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even a foundation that works
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}toward brain uploads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their point: the model has none
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:02:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the real fly's memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:00.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and separate software
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}does the walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The company's own chief executive
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is frank about how little went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Leaky integrate-and-fire is, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one of the simpler neuron models.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:09.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So you take kind of, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:10.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an okay connectome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I should say, the connectome
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}scan also not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:18.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A map of a brain, switched on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:20.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choosing what a body does next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:22.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The same executive
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}says that, optimistically,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:25.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the first human uploads
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are a few years away, not decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:30.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He also has a startup to fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yet of a human brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.39,0:03:33.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}science has mapped
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:35.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one cubic millimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:36.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A crumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:37.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its data filled more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:39.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than a million gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But suppose it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A copy wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with all your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:46.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or did you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:47.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}while something else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}remembers being you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So ask it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:53.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If the only way to stop dying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}were to become a copy, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.41,0:03:58.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which brings back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the answer most people give.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:01.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In 2013, a major American survey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:05.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}asked about treatments
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to live to 120.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most said, "not for me."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yet most believed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that other people would say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It seems everybody wants this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Except everybody you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What holds the yes back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This August, a new survey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}turned the question around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Would you accept a shorter life,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if it came without decline?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No failing body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No fading mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:32.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Almost 2 in 3 said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the fear isn't living forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's being old forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:43.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Healthy years included.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:51.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So ask it the fair way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If you could stop dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and stay healthy, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even then, there's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a serious case for no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One philosopher argued
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that an endless life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ends in boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Others answer that some
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:05.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pleasures never wear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:08.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But suppose enough people say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What happens to a world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:12.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that was built around dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:14.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Say it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In this scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you're older than anyone alive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:19.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}today, and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Take a promise you may have made:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}till death do us part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.45,0:05:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For most of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that usually meant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}less than 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now it has no end date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:29.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}More time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with the person you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a much bigger promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a life that long
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has to be paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A London professor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who studies long lives says
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the old plan, learn, work, retire,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:42.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:43.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But of course, when you think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about working into your 70s
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a three-stage life,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a full-time education,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}full-time work,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}full-time retirement,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that's obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:53.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:55.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So you could have five careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:57.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you might never be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And what your parents
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:05:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would have left you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In this scenario, it never comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your parents stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What they own stays with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:08.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And an inheritance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:13.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is only the small version.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Power and ideas change hands
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the same way:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}when someone goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Max Planck, the physicist,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}saw it in science.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A new truth, he wrote,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.89,0:06:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}doesn't win by
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}convincing its opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:27.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It wins because
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they eventually die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Economists later tested that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When a star scientist died early,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:34.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}outsiders moved in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and did unusually strong work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That doesn't make death good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It shows that people at the top
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can keep newcomers out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:43.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}just by staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And at the very top,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this subject has already come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Beijing, September 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A military parade,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:54.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a live microphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}China's president
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and Russia's president
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}walk toward the viewing platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Through his interpreter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:02.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Russia's president talks of organs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:04.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}transplanted again and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of people growing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}younger, even immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:09.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}China's president answers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that some predict
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:11.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}humans may live
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to 150 this century.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:16.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This isn't about two countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:17.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Any president.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Any judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:19.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Any founder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who steps aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if they never have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:24.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And who gets it at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In that survey from 2013,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a clear majority expected
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that only the wealthy would.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now ask yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:33.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Would you still say yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the powerful said yes first?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If you could afford it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and your neighbor couldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.85,0:07:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It doesn't have to go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:42.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Start with what people
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.93,0:07:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}actually said yes to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:47.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:49.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people spend close to 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:51.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of their lives in poor health.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:53.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Win those years back first,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:53.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and you shrink
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the very thing people fear:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the long decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:07:59.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But healthy years only count
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:01.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if people can afford them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some medical technology
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}gets cheap fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Reading a human genome once
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cost about $95 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Today, a few hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:13.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yet so far, in America,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:14.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}new medical technology
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has pushed health costs
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}up, not down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:20.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which pattern wins is still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Part of that comes down to rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:24.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Labs don't write those.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Voters and lawmakers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:28.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few exist already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:30.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who steps aside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}American presidents must,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}after two terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who pays for longer lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Denmark has tied
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its retirement age by law
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to how long people live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And who can afford it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:44.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A Montana law now lets
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}licensed clinics sell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:47.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}treatments after just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:48.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a first safety trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:50.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In return, 2%
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the profit must help
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:53.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people in the state get treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Supporters call that access.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Critics call it a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most rules for a world like this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have never been written.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:03.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How many children,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if so few of us go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One projection for Sweden
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:09.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}suggests its population
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would grow more slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:11.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than many fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even so, in this year's survey,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1 in 5 would accept
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stricter limits
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:17.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on having children,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:19.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for a much longer life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So is yours the first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation that won't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:27.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The honest answer is a range.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:28.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The estimates run
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from the next decade
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to four centuries from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:32.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And neither the repair
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:34.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}nor the copy has worked
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:36.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a single human being yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But something has already changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With AI, death has
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:41.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}moved from the things
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:42.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we accept to the things
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:43.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And what we work on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we have to think through,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:47.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Do we want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What does it do to a life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who gets it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If you could stop dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every generation before us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was given the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We are the first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to be asked the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:04.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's what this channel is for:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}making sure superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and that the answer stays yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:11.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
